Performance   : score = 0

Step  | Percept          | Action | Resulting world state     | Reward  | Score  | CleanCredit
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1     | (A, Clean)       | Right  | A=Clean  B=Dirty  agent@B |      -1 |     -1 | 1
2     | (B, Dirty)       | Suck   | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@B |     +10 |     +9 | 3
3     | (B, Clean)       | Left   | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@A |      -1 |     +8 | 5
4     | (A, Clean)       | Right  | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@B |      -1 |     +7 | 7
5     | (B, Clean)       | Left   | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@A |      -1 |     +6 | 9
6     | (A, Clean)       | Right  | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@B |      -1 |     +5 | 11
7     | (B, Clean)       | Left   | A=Clean  B=Clean  agent@A |      -1 |     +4 | 13
