20    | (5, Clean, L=False, R=True)  | Left   | [......]@4     |    +24 | -
Final : [......]@4   score = +24   squares still dirty = 0

&gt;&gt;&gt; B. Reflex agent + heading (one bit of state)
Step  | Percept                      | Action | World          | Score  | Agent state
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1     | (0, Dirty, L=True, R=False)  | Suck   | [.#.#.#]@0     |    +10 | heading=Right
2     | (0, Clean, L=True, R=False)  | Right  | [.#.#.#]@1     |     +9 | heading=Right
3     | (1, Dirty, L=False, R=False) | Suck   | [...#.#]@1     |    +19 | heading=Right
4     | (1, Clean, L=False, R=False) | Right  | [...#.#]@2     |    +18 | heading=Right
5     | (2, Clean, L=False, R=False) | Right  | [...#.#]@3     |    +17 | heading=Right
