============================================================================================
SCALING WITH CORRIDOR LENGTH  (start in the middle, 20 steps, seed 7)
============================================================================================
N      | naive reflex   | reflex+heading   | model-based    | dirty left (naive / heading / model)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2      | 2              | 2                | 19             | 0 / 0 / 0
4      | -9             | 13               | 26             | 2 / 0 / 0
